      "result": "Post hoc lipoylation/PDH/TCA module lower across four independent cohorts (effect -0.245, 95% CI -0.363 to -0.127, I2 0%, q 0.035). PDHA1 direction consistent in four cohorts but gene-level q 0.086. Not AD-specific versus Huntington or vascular dementia; no evidence for cuproptosis.",
